    "zh": "每个问题之后会有十秒钟的停顿。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "pause"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen008.png",
    "sha256": "9ad5509440d49cf41e4b4656f3f212890574ceb4584950bd4cd56007578bfdfb",
    "k": 7,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "instruction",
    "en": "During the pause, you should read the four choices of A, B, C and D, and mark the best answer to each question on Answer Sheet two.",
    "zh": "请利用停顿时间阅读A、B、C、D四个选项，并在答题卡二上标出每题的最佳答案。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "choice"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen009.png",
    "sha256": "792d96a464c47105c3f15016fb407caca5ed3e99cf94d1929dddce5c8d9a99c6",
    "k": 8,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "instruction",
    "en": "You have thirty seconds to preview the questions.",
    "zh": "你有三十秒钟预览题目。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "preview"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen010.png",
    "sha256": "94e97315417b78b2fff4a6e41040b3ad8ed217d356993eeb87461fa85c13dae4",
    "k": 9,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "transition",
    "en": "Now listen to part one of the interview.",
    "zh": "现在请听访谈的第一部分。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "listen"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen011.png",
    "sha256": "0759423c52d0f278e05d04f845492e5ad0d0da8fed624f085e7c0109549de337",
    "k": 10,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "transition",
    "en": "Questions 1 to 5 are based on part 1 of the interview.",
    "zh": "第1至5题根据访谈的第一部分提问。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "be based on"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen012.png",
    "sha256": "76adc8819f67e7e9ccbd1d2dec62b536fed1b83eb1c34ba52027a2248a6ca0d5",
    "k": 11,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Good morning, Mr. West. Nice to have you on our program.",
    "zh": "早上好，韦斯特先生。很高兴请您参加我们的节目。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "program"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen013.png",
    "sha256": "a75f27b105e40774d737efc22f80619de4dad9903d3417ec7e737944a016ea4e",
    "k": 12,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Good morning.",
    "zh": "早上好。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "morning"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen014.png",
    "sha256": "b4fc35811108dd943fbc4534693ec6e75a6e116c0b73e2fb9e20a8247d9f4b32",
    "k": 13,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "OK. We all work or very few people can get away with not working.",
    "zh": "我们都需要工作，或者说，只有极少数人可以不工作而照样生活。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "get away with"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen015.png",
    "sha256": "9e83268fa2fac3b11aeac777fb10e8f026c417279b35f79563e667ad1e0b6c9e",
    "k": 14,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Work is a fact of life when we’re adults.",
    "zh": "成年以后，工作就是生活中必须面对的现实。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "a fact of life"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen016.png",
    "sha256": "36b829b7071773fb1c9fcc1b9ce9d1ed7b02e7955824b768728defe02d7a731a",
    "k": 15,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "But before, there wasn’t a lot of choice in the selection of work.",
    "zh": "但在过去，人们择业时并没有多少选择。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "selection"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen017.png",
    "sha256": "68c9eb12a8b07022b1a0c3d57074476bf3b1411a3a88c1e7e4d2b987bc19c5f7",
    "k": 16,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Now things are different.",
    "zh": "现在情况不同了。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "different"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen018.png",
    "sha256": "fb5011bee9b4ad5d422936ce472fd932d2f22367e693b4e7913dc835c5d5a214",
    "k": 17,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "With greater mobility, the mobility that is offered when people have greater opportunities for higher education or training, ",
    "zh": "当人们获得更多接受高等教育或培训的机会时，流动性也随之增强，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "mobility",
      "higher education"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen019.png",
    "sha256": "d73b21aeeac8922fc88001e333e81554d02f22406121a913128d9fbe7bd6caa4",
    "k": 17,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "more and more people are able to choose the fields that interest them.",
    "zh": "越来越多的人因此能够选择自己感兴趣的领域。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "field"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen020.png",
    "sha256": "e64f381094c3a1f1f56362d9820039f38096051ab7ed7396a4ac99776ecc67e3",
    "k": 18,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "They can and do have opinions about what makes one job for them better than another job.",
    "zh": "他们能够，而且也确实会判断：对自己来说，什么使一份工作比另一份更好。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "opinion"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen021.png",
    "sha256": "98cc9f75d742b79e6b65499e26a888acc7bcdd5d9d430c4b95e1046257b18972",
    "k": 19,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "So, Mr. West, what do people actually want from their jobs?",
    "zh": "那么，韦斯特先生，人们究竟希望从工作中获得什么呢？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "actually"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen022.png",
    "sha256": "8478595ea42492defb25d8639e207641d25815b51c0c722891147aaf600489be",
    "k": 20,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "What are workers’ opinions, you know, about what makes one job better than another?",
    "zh": "也就是说，劳动者如何看待一份工作胜过另一份工作的原因？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "worker"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen023.png",
    "sha256": "e5ba0a9c991f7c5316d482fb138c67365d409346b6c2b22d771fafbdb17ac322",
    "k": 21,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Well, to answer your questions, I’d like to look at two polls, two surveys.",
    "zh": "要回答您的问题，我想介绍两项民意调查。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "poll",
      "survey"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen024.png",
    "sha256": "736e2ad5a5fad623dc9dd039467ec458a32499b5aa02df9a890778de2c509b69",
    "k": 22,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "They were both done in the 1990s.",
    "zh": "两项调查都是在二十世纪九十年代开展的。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "do"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen025.png",
    "sha256": "0d0d5ac2b1f615bf4bb592a15c9b455e3e335a74027822878f1131db08db249c",
    "k": 23,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "The purposes were to find out what issues or job characteristics were especially important to workers.",
    "zh": "调查目的是了解，哪些问题或工作特点对劳动者来说尤其重要。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "issue",
      "characteristic"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen026.png",
    "sha256": "afed7247095854b82731c8b231315c36e4ff5a9caf0efe737dbf714512611c6c",
    "k": 24,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Umm. What were they?",
    "zh": "那么，具体是哪些呢？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "what were they"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen027.png",
    "sha256": "60cdac6008ff3a4c5e350753267e47bdf4724212ab3eb53cab6ef9d0adfe5d49",
    "k": 25,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Some of you might guess that the answer is obvious.",
    "zh": "有些人可能会觉得，答案显而易见。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "obvious"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen028.png",
    "sha256": "a9c5efc2f8e47d26544114c5c5532b04f80ea6684f629aee4bf534e3ff1ee7ad",
    "k": 26,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "I think so.",
    "zh": "我也这么想。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "think so"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen029.png",
    "sha256": "47dbbacbde82ac95a0705bb262b7645d96325da5b7e22fdf20f7d7c09eb32332",
    "k": 27,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "You might say “oh people just want higher salaries, more money.”",
    "zh": "您可能会说：“人们无非就是想要更高的工资、更多的钱。”",
    "vocabulary": [
      "salary"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen030.png",
    "sha256": "15fc0f77aecee75b7d2775e078b48b863f7bb1645e83072c40db76408fde8fa8",
    "k": 28,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "But let’s see if that’s true.",
    "zh": "不过，我们来看看事实是否如此。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "true"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen031.png",
    "sha256": "8a066cbd527f2ae35d409d2fb5c54182315c7b5fca9ce024e73b36a9a7ea1a77",
    "k": 29,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "OK.",
    "zh": "好。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "OK"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen032.png",
    "sha256": "01744e67653633ae7bb0f1da542a44e1cfcd67fbf2c748d58be3e529c445685c",
    "k": 30,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Now, the first poll.",
    "zh": "先来看第一项调查。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "poll"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen033.png",
    "sha256": "bc1a9955a8640808ee113bc748d85869be34050d27000e5ee576be4c727062b1",
    "k": 31,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "The first poll was taken in 1990, and this poll asked respondents to choose what was the most important to them among five items.",
    "zh": "第一项调查开展于一九九〇年，要求受访者从五个项目中选出对自己最重要的一项。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "respondent"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen034.png",
    "sha256": "1a89788933cf59c27c56aef843b5efd150b806204482f63f67f3525d8d4a9846",
    "k": 32,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "And they were only allowed to choose one out of the five items.",
    "zh": "五个项目中，他们只能选一个。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "allow"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen035.png",
    "sha256": "f64c61476f6e3f8f40c40cd8b60dff3c06fd898552c0f9c645dd949cf1d2118c",
    "k": 33,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "So what were the five items?",
    "zh": "那么，这五个项目是什么呢？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "item"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen036.png",
    "sha256": "3e60f220cc1a3feb2993ce3f6395c8049cb0974e6428cd3d0962c2a249875c73",
    "k": 34,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Alright. The first item was important and meaningful work.",
    "zh": "第一项，是工作重要且有意义。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "meaningful"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen037.png",
    "sha256": "922a3b26c2481d515f394fa7c1b4d94dd320deaf0d0df67d74d03f09f10d8d03",
    "k": 35,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "The second was high income.",
    "zh": "第二项，是高收入。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "income"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen038.png",
    "sha256": "067d2b15c7645ca04bd2193f12e081fcdfd77703fac9f03d0d16401faee607d7",
    "k": 36,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "The third was chances for advancement, promotion and so on.",
    "zh": "第三项，是职业发展、晋升等机会。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "advancement",
      "promotion"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen039.png",
    "sha256": "d2d927e020ba060785a57d239c64f51386fd54f51bd517c14886103b829ed4d9",
    "k": 37,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "The fourth item was job security, and the fifth was shorter work hours, OK?",
    "zh": "第四项，是工作稳定有保障；第五项，是工作时间更短。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "job security"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen040.png",
    "sha256": "97defb5c6652f2bec50f61e7f11127280e9038285a18aed0d38bf3085b46c211",
    "k": 38,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "It would be interesting to know the survey results.",
    "zh": "我很想了解调查结果。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "survey result"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen041.png",
    "sha256": "1d29718c6e7538a20a89beb3a618f0e7f1f7525260f4d21b0b7d823f5c3e50bd",
    "k": 39,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Yes, now let me tell you the results.",
    "zh": "好的，现在我来介绍结果。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "result"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen042.png",
    "sha256": "295d3245efed3a3d849e8a88605aaa1c0e9f96083d341d7353b77eb2624c241b",
    "k": 40,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "50% considered important and meaningful work the most important characteristic of a job.",
    "zh": "百分之五十的人认为，工作重要且有意义是最重要的工作特点。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "consider"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen043.png",
    "sha256": "ce71e0be4f4dee241aebcb350fc9f126f80e15b4e93355a2d699e332ae483604",
    "k": 41,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "They didn’t choose high income.",
    "zh": "他们没有选择高收入。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "income"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen044.png",
    "sha256": "ae75af5b1e317971ae95f7bada9d5aa6c5bb70baf8d18392611fec57a7a1921a",
    "k": 42,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Interesting.",
    "zh": "很有意思。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "interesting"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen045.png",
    "sha256": "5833470f4bde8275951dff018d6c0bd9d5e2b545b29ff4354d4480013426f209",
    "k": 43,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Anyway, 24% did say high income was the most important characteristic of a job.",
    "zh": "而百分之二十四的人确实认为，高收入是工作最重要的特点。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "characteristic"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen046.png",
    "sha256": "36191dd108a97243a2197a074010ce43896f1f19c8484fbfcc6ca5f2ddddb299",
    "k": 44,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Of the remaining, 16% said chances for advancement was most important.",
    "zh": "在其余的人中，百分之十六认为晋升机会最重要。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "remaining",
      "advancement"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen047.png",
    "sha256": "4f3cd066df8bf4967b1dba15efaf1e5e575b05f9c772af7a73009043dcd3e67c",
    "k": 45,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Maybe these were younger workers, starting out on a career.",
    "zh": "这些人也许是刚开始职业生涯的年轻劳动者。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "start out",
      "career"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen048.png",
    "sha256": "3e83162142320365aa85a38327ddf9430e8def7194aa3439bf7496d058550f9b",
    "k": 46,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "6% said job security and finally 4% said shorter work hours was most important.",
    "zh": "百分之六的人认为工作保障最重要，最后还有百分之四的人选择了更短的工作时间。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "job security"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen049.png",
    "sha256": "ec94466f59202ff8595eb09282cbe4562aec91d5e6333b08b02b208488662967",
    "k": 47,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
